      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>WRETCHED PRISONER — CR 0 rescue NPC (run several, generic). A starved, beaten slave in the staging mine near Dhul Maldur; freed or extracted during the mine breakout. Escort liability — the cost of saving them.</p><p><strong>Manual — Wretched:</strong> starved, beaten, exhausted — disadvantage on STR &amp; CON checks and saves; can't Dash two rounds running.</p><p><strong>Manual — Won't fight (RP):</strong> cowers, flees, or clings to rescuers; acts only if cornered. Needs escort/protecting through the breakout.</p><p><strong>Manual — Desperate Surge (1/day):</strong> when freed, or when a rescuer takes a hit for them, adrenaline grants one extra move OR a Help action this turn.</p>"
      }
    }
